訪新店家，環境明亮整潔，中午時段用餐不用特別排隊，餐點以價位CP值來說表現不差\n\n點了招牌豚骨拉麵（麵硬）、雞白湯（麵軟）\n不知道是不是因為細麵是黃麵的因素，本身比較有嚼勁，兩碗吃不出任何軟硬度上的差別🤔\n豚骨湯頭算安全牌，有鹹度沒腥味，雞白湯見仁見智⋯個人不愛（覺得有一種胡椒中藥味）\n可惜麵體機乎都沒辦法吸附湯汁入味，有種麵湯分離的感覺\n豬叉燒就..個人口味覺得有點像在吃叉燒口味的假肉？附半顆溏心蛋吃起來沒毛病\n看到店內有推薦美味吃法，加獨門辣醬吃～\n很失望一點辣度都沒有，平常吃小辣的我只感覺加了湯頭變挺油⋯（連同行媽媽不敢吃辣淺嚐都吃不懂）\n\n份量上女生吃的飽不會到撐，建議男生吃應該要加麵\n服務上沒有太大問題，因為不用服務費，也不強求店員態度要多親切（但總感覺店員有種很不想上班or被霸凌😅在等下班的既視感？）\n也許是因為學區，聘請一些打工的學生，但還是想鼓勵其實在服務業還是有很多值得學習的態度與服務品質～\n\n以此次經驗還是認為這價位，還不如吃初原麵場（私心認為至少吃完會有拉麵的幸福感）口味表現也優於麵匡匡很多\n有機會路過還是會考慮二訪，就當速食拉麵快餐，可能會想試鹹蛋黃麵\n🔺不會開發票…",null,[0,62]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5030342848125941129/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklPVFJpVFZsbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5030342848125941129/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklPVFJpVFZsbkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5030342848125941129/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklPVFJpVFZsbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5030342848125941129/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklPVFJpVFZsbkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5030342848125941129/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklPVFJpVFZsbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5030342848125941129/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklPVFJpVFZsbkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,6505,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNIOTRiTVlnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xba3af06f35814599!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICH94bMYg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNIOTRiTVlnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNIOTRiTVlnEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ0g5NGJNNGdFEhNDZ3dJaGFEX3RnWVFrSWV2a1FFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ0g5NGJNRWcSE0Nnd0l6Sm5fdGdZUXdKLVdod0UiEgkAAAAAAAAAABGZRYE1b_A6uioLMGFyeC00SDl3REY\u0026wv\u003d1\u0